    "This device is out of space, so My Business couldn’t open its saved data. Nothing was deleted. Free up space, then close and reopen the app. Until then, changes won’t be kept after you close it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This device is out of space, so My Business couldn’t open its saved data. Nothing was deleted. Free up space, then close and reopen the app. Until then, changes won’t be kept after you close it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este dispositivo no tiene espacio, así que My Business no pudo abrir sus datos guardados. No se borró nada. Libera espacio y luego cierra y vuelve a abrir la app. Hasta entonces, los cambios no se conservarán al cerrarla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved copy on this device couldn’t be read, so it was reset. Your backed-up business data re-downloads from your Gold Life account, but changes this device hadn’t backed up yet may be missing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The saved copy on this device couldn’t be read, so it was reset. Your backed-up business data re-downloads from your Gold Life account, but changes this device hadn’t backed up yet may be missing."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La copia guardada en este dispositivo no se pudo leer, así que se restableció. Los datos respaldados de tu negocio se vuelven a descargar de tu cuenta Gold Life, pero es posible que falten los cambios que este dispositivo aún no había respaldado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved copy on this device couldn’t be read, so it was reset. Your business data re-downloads from your Gold Life account. The 1 change that wasn’t backed up yet was kept on this device.": {
